      "widgets_values": [
        "## wan-vace-join-lab-example\n\nOpt-in Wan 2.1 VACE 1.3B Apache join smoke. Not download-models.\nDownload: ./scripts/utilities/download-wan.sh run --tier vace\nUnload LTX first. MagCache is off (never on this graph).\nFrame count is 17 (1+8n, inside 16\u201324). Even latents crash.\nModels: diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors (VACE 1.3B) + umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors (CLIP type wan) + wan2.2_vae.safetensors.\nLoad Shot A last frame and Shot B first frame. Native WanVaceToVideo is the intended join when the Comfy pin exposes it; this graph Queues on core Wan22ImageToVideoLatent so the canvas loads without a missing-node error.\nPRIMARY OUTPUT: VHS_VideoCombine MP4 24 fps. Prefix ez_vace_join.\nDo not coreside with TRELLIS, Fun InP, SeedVR2, or LTX.\nPrompt enhance is on by default (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). After Queue, the Enhance node shows the prompt CLIP used (or a passthrough reason). Turn Enhance off to use the widget text as-is. Optional style dropdown.\n"
